1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,526
Last check in.

2
00:00:01,566 --> 00:00:03,468
Pull out your week one map.

3
00:00:03,508 --> 00:00:08,458
Rate your anxiety and curiosity again, and set them next to your first numbers.

4
00:00:08,498 --> 00:00:11,792
Then, in a new color, redo your marks.

5
00:00:11,832 --> 00:00:13,411
What would you add?

6
00:00:13,451 --> 00:00:17,920
What changed? What story is your mind telling about AI now?

7
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,830
And what didn't change?

8
00:00:19,870 --> 00:00:21,716
That's a valid answer too.

9
00:00:21,756 --> 00:00:25,493
Pick one practice you'll keep and decide when and where.

10
00:00:25,533 --> 00:00:30,196
Last thing, write one sentence you'd tell a friend who's anxious about AI.

11
00:00:31,237 --> 00:00:35,154
Thank you for showing up curious, thoughtful, and human.
